(  Did you find any vulnerabilities in the contract?) Tj T*
(    No audit happened, so "found" is the wrong word. But HZ-016 is not a shape: the behaviour was) Tj T*
(    reproduced against this exact contract, not a lookalike - a token that calls the recipient back) Tj T*
(    mid-transfer drains a counterparty that settles after paying. That makes it a demonstrated hazard) Tj T*
(    rather than a candidate; it becomes a finding when somebody shows it is reachable, and a bug when) Tj T*
(    the code is not meant to behave that way. Nothing else matched.) Tj T*
(    seen: no matching selector, so this is its shape) Tj T*
(    not answered here: Whether anything here is reachable, and whether it is a bug rather than a) Tj T*
(    decision. Presence is not proof; absence is not clearance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  So is it safe to use?) Tj T*
(    Unknown, and this sheet will not pretend otherwise. What it can say is narrow and true: which hazard) Tj T*
(    shapes are present \(1\), which behaviours have been demonstrated \(a placard that says confirmed\), and) Tj T*
(    which classes the code does not match at all. What it cannot say is whether any of them is) Tj T*
(    reachable, whether the economics make it exploitable, or whether a hazard is a bug or a deliberate) Tj T*
(    choice - intent is not in the bytecode.) Tj T*
(    seen: no matching selector, so this is its shape) Tj T*
(    not answered here: The honest one: the state of the owner key, what you have approved, and what) Tj T*
(    happens to the contract after this block.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  What is this?) Tj T*
(    It is a token contract verified as IMBTC. Everything below is read from the bytecode it exposes, not) Tj T*
(    from its docs.) Tj T*
(    seen: no matching selector, so this is its shape) Tj T*
(    not answered here: Whether it is any good, and who wrote it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Can they freeze or block my tokens?) Tj T*
(    Yes, transfers can be paused: the contract carries pause/unpause, so a holder of that key can stop) Tj T*
(    everyone moving tokens, including you.) Tj T*
(    seen: 0x8456cb59 pause\(\), 0x3f4ba83a unpause\(\), 0x5c975abb paused\(\)) Tj T*
(    not answered here: Who holds the pause key, and whether the pause affects withdrawals too.) Tj T*
(    related hazard: HZ-013) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Can transfers be switched off entirely?) Tj T*
(    Yes. Transfers can be turned on and off as a switch, which is how some tokens spend their first days) Tj T*
(    restricted to a whitelist.) Tj T*
